Trade-offs to evaluate:
  • direct: Sequential landing on development. Best when PRs are small, independent,
            and have zero or low conflict risk. Each PR exercises the gate independently.
  • group:  Combine candidates into a single integration branch (staging/<topic> or group/<topic>),
